// EU07 / 303E - the contactors, as camshaft sets for Knsgf's electric_sim.
//
// GENERATED by build_contactors.py from contactor_programme.json (sheet 3 of the 303E
// schemat ideowy, read from the drawing's geometry). Change it there, not here.
//
// Compiles against WE6SIM (branch full_circuit, 2026-10-09) and runs on his solver: see
// eu07_bench.cs. The tables and the hand-over between the two main sets are also checked
// here, by a port of his parser and switch walked through several thousand controller steps.
//
// The controller wheel is positional and the contactors follow it a position at a time,
// stepped from the simulation tick (eu07_contactors.simulate). His camshaft_motor is not
// used: the EU07 has no camshaft, each contactor has a valve of its own.

